00:11:39.000 --> 00:11:40.067
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:11:40.067 --> 00:11:41.968
Good news.

00:11:41.968 --> 00:11:43.033
Yeah, it all works out.

00:11:43.033 --> 00:11:44.534
♪♪

00:11:44.534 --> 00:11:48.367
We're very excited here, guys.
